<span id="A2.T4.pic1.1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T4.pic1.1.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Does the predicted answer match the ground truth? Answer 1 for match and 0 for not match.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.pic1.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.pic1.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T4.pic1.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:395.7pt;">
<span id="A2.T4.pic1.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T4.pic1.1.8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Use semantic meaning not exact match. Synonyms are also treated as a match, e.g., football and soccer, playground and ground track field, building and rooftop, pond and swimming pool.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.pic1.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.pic1.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
